WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: fr

NOTE Edition A (domestic / welcoming community). French caption, English gloss in italics. The 16.0-17.5 s crossover has no caption (music only).

a1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Rue Raymond-Queneau, fin d'après-midi.
<i>Raymond Queneau Street, late afternoon.</i>

a2
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:13.500
Madame Ferrand rentre des courses.
<i>Madame Ferrand is back from the shops.</i>

a3
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:20.300
Six heures : on rentre, une fenêtre après l'autre.
<i>Six o'clock: people come home, one window after another.</i>

a4
00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:25.500
— C'est toi ? Le thé est prêt.
<i>Is that you? The tea is ready.</i>

a5
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:29.800
Ici, tout le monde se connaît.
<i>Here, everyone knows everyone.</i>
